{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "da44cdc0-5e2f-443a-831a-bfc7762b9dbb",
    "name": "📌 MiniMax API",
    "description": "### About MiniMax\n\n\"Global leader in multi-modal models and AI-native products with over 200 million users.\"\n\nMiniMax builds its own language, speech, image and video models and serves them through its own API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- MiniMax Account: [https://platform.minimax.io/](https://platform.minimax.io/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `minimax_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:minimax_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/api-overview](https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/api-overview)\n    \n- Models: [https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/api-overview](https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/api-overview)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-11T21:25:49.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T23:53:39.000Z",
